  ('Bachelor of Science Ecology & Biodiversity', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Malaya (UM)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 3003, '4 years', '["Mar","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Science in Ecology & Biodiversity program at Universiti Malaya UM offers a comprehensive exploration of the scientific studies related to various organisms, their diversity, and their interactions with the environment Malaysia''s rich biodiversity in both terrestrial and aquatic ecosystems plays vital roles in supporting life by providing quality air, food, water, and various health and economic benefits

Unfortunately, habitat destruction and other anthropogenic impacts are leading to significant biodiversity loss, particularly in tropical regions As a response, studies focused on documenting biodiversity and understanding its linkages to the environment are crucial for the nation

This program aims to produce well-rounded graduates who specialize in ecology and biodiversity, aligning with Malaysia''s vision to conserve its biodiversity and promote the sustainable use of biological resources By equipping students with the necessary knowledge and skills, the program prepares them to contribute effectively to conservation efforts and sustainable practices in the field of ecology and biodiversity

- National Higher School Certificate (or an Advanced Level equivalent) with the grade 80% and above.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., UEC, Foundation, STAM, etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Specialist in field"]'::jsonb, 'Free', '- National Higher School Certificate (or an Advanced Level equivalent) with the grade 80% and above.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., UEC, Foundation, STAM, etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
  ('Bachelor of Science Microbiology & Molecular Genetics', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Malaya (UM)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 2877, '4 years', '["Mar","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Science in Microbiology & Molecular Genetics program at Universiti Malaya UM is a newly established course that combines two fundamental biological sciences: microbiology and genetics This innovative program covers essential topics such as microbes and genes, inheritance and mutations, and the roles of bacteria, viruses, and other microbes in the environment and as pathogens

The program has garnered significant recognition, ranked 137th in the Best Global Universities for Microbiology and listed among the top 200 in the QS World Subject Rankings for Biological Sciences Additionally, it is the first of its kind in Malaysia, demonstrating a commitment to advancing the study of these critical fields and preparing graduates for diverse career opportunities in research, healthcare, and environmental sciences.

- National Higher School Certificate (or an Advanced Level equivalent) with the grade 80% and above.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., UEC, Foundation, STAM, etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

