  ('Bachelor of Al-Quran and Al-Hadith', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Malaya (UM)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4305, '3 years', '["Mar","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Al-Quran and Al-Hadith program at Universiti Malaya (UM) is dedicated to advancing the study of these foundational Islamic texts. The program integrates traditional Islamic knowledge with modern scientific methods, aiming to provide quality education that benefits both the nation and humanity.

Through a comprehensive curriculum, students will explore the interpretations, applications, and significance of Al-Quran and Al-Hadith in contemporary contexts. This approach not only deepens their understanding of these texts but also equips them with the skills necessary to contribute meaningfully to discussions and practices related to Islamic teachings in today''s world.

