  ('Bachelor of Computer Science (Computer System and Network)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Malaya (UM)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 5405, '3 years', '["Mar","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Computer Science (Computer System and Network) program at Universiti Malaya UM is designed to produce graduates who have a strong understanding of networking and computer system theories This program equips students with the knowledge and skills necessary to apply critical thinking and advanced scientific techniques in addressing computer-based problems

