  ('Bachelor of English Language and Linguistics', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Malaya (UM)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4165, '3 years', '["Mar","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of English Language and Linguistics program at Universiti Malaya (UM) is designed to produce graduates who excel in language and linguistics, particularly in English. The program prepares students to be competitive in their careers and responsible members of society, instilling strong ethical values.

