  ('Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Malaya (UM)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 29621, '5 years', '["Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery program at Universiti Malaya (UM) is a comprehensive five-year professional undergraduate medical degree. The Universiti Malaya Medical Programme (UMMP) offers students clinical experience, research opportunities, and elective placements. Upon successful completion, graduates are awarded the MBBS degree.

The program emphasizes current best practices in medical education, featuring high teacher-student ratios and extensive educational support. Graduates will be well-prepared to address the health needs of individuals, families, and society, with a commitment to improving the healthcare system at all levels.

