  ('Bachelor of Urban & Regional Planning', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Malaya (UM)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4791, '4 years', '["Mar","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Urban and Regional Planning program at Universiti Malaya (UM) is a professional program aligned with the requirements of the Board of Town Planners Malaysia. This program distinguishes itself from similar offerings at other universities, such as UTM, UiTM, UIA, and USM, by focusing on spatial planning for sustainable development.

