  ('Bachelor in Data Science (Honours)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4781, '3 years', '["Jan","Nov","Feb"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor in Data Science (Honours) at Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT) prepares students for careers as data professionals or data scientists by combining training in computer science and data science.

In today''s data-driven world, graduates are in high demand for their ability to analyze big data to enhance business processes, optimize resources, increase profits, improve customer satisfaction, and personalize experiences. The program covers specialized courses such as Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Visualization, Data Engineering, Data Warehouse Technology, and Statistics for Data Science, alongside core computing courses like Programming, Database Management, and Computer Networks.

