  ('Bachelor of Manufacturing & Industrial Technology with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4400, '3.5 years', '["Jan","Nov","Feb"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Manufacturing & Industrial Technology with Honours at Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT) is a multidisciplinary program that focuses on designing and developing manufacturing systems and industrial processes. It integrates principles from technology and management to optimize production efficiency, quality, and operational performance.

