  ('Bachelor of Science (Hons) in Sports and Exercise Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4781, '3 years', '["Jan","Nov"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Science (Hons) in Sports and Exercise Science at Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT) offers a comprehensive foundation in the academic principles related to sports and exercise. The program emphasizes the application of scientific principles and interdisciplinary approaches, equipping students with both theoretical and practical knowledge.

