  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Psychology By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT)' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 1643, '3 years', '["Jan","Feb","Mar","Apr","May","Jun","Jul","Aug","Sep","Oct","Nov","Dec"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy in Psychology by Research Mode at Tunku Abdul Rahman University of Management and Technology (TAR UMT) is tailored to prepare postgraduates for careers in both academia and non-academic fields that require extensive research training. This research-intensive program aims to equip students with critical knowledge to evaluate contemporary issues across various psychology domains.

