  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Agricultural Extension by Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Doctor of Philosophy in Agricultural Extension By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) explores the fundamental concepts and objectives of agricultural extension, including the roles of extension workers, the history and organization of extension services, and various extension methods and techniques. The program delves into the extension process, rural sociology, leadership patterns in rural communities, and community organization.

