  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Immunobiology By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Doctor of Philosophy in Immunobiology By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) provides an advanced exploration of the immune system and its functions in protecting the body from foreign intrusions. This program emphasizes in-depth research on the basic immunological principles, including the structure, development, and functionality of immune cells and organs.

