  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Statistics By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Doctor of Philosophy in Statistics By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) offers a specialized study of advanced statistical methodologies and applications. The program explores key areas such as Robust Statistics, Extreme Value Theory, Bayesian Modelling and Inference, Multivariate Analysis, Survival Analysis, and Time Series.

