  ('Master of Architecture By Coursework Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Architecture By Coursework Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) is a 65-credit hour postgraduate program designed to provide a professional qualification equivalent to Part II of the Board of Architects Malaysia (LAM).

