  ('Master of Automotive Engineering By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Automotive Engineering By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) encompasses both basic and applied research in the development and design of automotive technologies, systems, and components.

