  ('Master of Biochemical Engineering By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Biochemical Engineering By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) focuses on the application of chemical engineering principles to living systems and biological materials, including microbes, cells, enzymes, proteins, nucleic acids, carbohydrates, oils, and fats.

