  ('Master of Science in Animal Welfare By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Science in Animal Welfare By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) emphasizes the principles of the five domains of animal welfare: nutritional, environmental, health, behavioral, and mental well-being. This specialization focuses on the identification, investigation, evaluation, proposal, and management of animal welfare issues using indices of deprivation across these domains.

