  ('Master of Science in Biopolymer, Pulp and Paper Technology By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Science in Biopolymer, Pulp and Paper Technology By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) focuses on various systems related to mechanical, semi-mechanical, chemical, and biological pulping. The program emphasizes fiber characterization and properties, including physical, morphological, chemical, and mechanical aspects, as well as bleaching processes, bio-bleaching, and chemical modifications of fibers.

