  ('Master of Science in Intelligent Systems By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Science in Intelligent Systems By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) focuses on the research and development of intelligent computing theories, designs, implementations, and applications. The program explores new techniques for transforming massive data into valuable information and knowledge, including genetic algorithms, swarm optimization, and ant colony optimization.

