  ('Master of Science in Numerical Analysis By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Science in Numerical Analysis By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) focuses on developing numerical methods for approximating solutions to differential and integral equations. The program emphasizes the analysis of iterative methods, stability, and error analysis, with particular attention to the numerical solutions of stiff ordinary differential equations, delay differential equations, and boundary value problems.

