  ('Master of Science in Occupational Safety and Health By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Science in Occupational Safety and Health By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) is offered through the Department of Environmental and Occupational Health. This program provides a comprehensive foundation of knowledge, subject-matter expertise, essential skills, and a global network of opportunities that equip students to enhance their careers in this vital field.

