  ('Master of Science in Virology By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Science in Virology By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) offers an in-depth study of viruses and virus-like agents, including prions and viroids, as well as the diseases they cause. This program emphasizes research focused on various aspects of virology, including virus structure, classification and evolution, and mechanisms of viral infection and replication within host cells.

