Research focuses on bacterial diseases that have significant economic implications for the animal and veterinary industries, as well as those that impact public health. Students will utilize various advanced techniques in bacteriological research, including molecular biology, biotechnology, genomics, and proteomics. This program equips graduates with the knowledge and skills necessary to address pressing challenges in veterinary bacteriology effectively.

