  ('Master of Veterinary Science in Pathology By Research Mode', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM)' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 0, '2 years', '["Oct","Mar"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Veterinary Science in Pathology By Research Mode at Universiti Putra Malaysia (UPM) emphasizes the study of animal disease pathology, focusing on zoonoses and infections affecting laboratory animals. This program covers a broad spectrum of topics, including general pathology, specific and systemic pathology, and the identification and assessment of pathological changes at various levels: gross, histopathological, ultrastructural, and molecular.

